#### Tool 2: `security_checklist.json`
*This acts as an automated security review. The AI will check every mapped field against this list.*

```json
{
  "forbidden_field_patterns": [
    ".*password.*",
    ".*salt.*",
    ".*hash.*",
    "^internal_.*",
    ".*_db_id$",
    "ssn",
    "social_security"
  ],
  "masking_rules": {
    "creditCardNumber": "Mask all but last 4 digits",
    "emailAddress": "Return full email only if profile page, otherwise mask"
  }
}